### Requests for 03_errors_and_validation.js
### VS Code: install "REST Client" (Huachao Mao), then click "Send Request" above each block.
### Start the server first:
###   docker compose exec node node week07/class1/03_errors_and_validation.js

@base = http://localhost:3001

### List products
GET {{base}}/api/products

### Add a valid product -> 201
POST {{base}}/api/products
Content-Type: application/json

{ "name": "Phone", "price": 800 }

### Missing name and bad price -> 400 with details
POST {{base}}/api/products
Content-Type: application/json

{ "price": -5 }

### Body isn't valid JSON -> express.json() rejects it (400)
POST {{base}}/api/products
Content-Type: application/json

{ not json }

### A route that throws -> caught by the error handler (500)
GET {{base}}/api/boom

### No such route -> the 404 middleware
GET {{base}}/api/nope
